/bin/
/cartographer
/demo-kb/
*.sqlite
*.db
.DS_Store
migrated-kb/
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/agents/
# Per-client MCP configuration is machine-local, as CONTRIBUTING.md says: written
# by `cartographer connect`, never committed.
.mcp.json
.codex/config.toml
opencode.json
# Machine-local client state, never ours to track.
.agents/
# Isolated worktrees for plan branches (see `make worktree-add`): never tracked.
/.worktrees/
/data/kb/
!/data/kb/.gitkeep
.env
age-key.txt
.vscode/
graphify-out/
dist/
# The Atlas UI's production bundle is the one generated artifact this
# repository tracks on purpose (D227): `go install` cannot run an npm build, so
# the binary has to carry it. internal/webui's provenance test fails when it is
# stale, and `make web` regenerates it.
!internal/webui/dist/

# Local agent-tooling state (oh-my-claudecode), never versioned.
.omc/
# Terraform for the live demo (deploy/demo): state and account ids stay local.
/deploy/demo/.terraform/
*.tfstate*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
# `make hero` preview (D790): the README's copy lives on the readme-assets branch.
/hero.webp

# The launch film renders (film/README.md).
film/out/
/cmd/cartographer/cartographer
